    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "Use content direction to specify the direction of the x-axis, which the audio graph represents as time.",
      "ko": "콘텐츠 방향을 사용해 오디오 그래프에서 시간을 나타내는 x축 방향을 지정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "b34f7bebdb3685e53268b34bc89295e761c207221eb4d058b69defd793ecd30a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0002",
      "source": "For example, a bar chart might have a content direction of [`AXChartDescriptor.ContentDirection.leftToRight`](axchartdescriptor/contentdirection-swift.enum/lefttoright.md), and a pie chart might have a content direction of [`AXChartDescriptor.ContentDirection.radialClockwise`](axchartdescriptor/contentdirection-swift.enum/radialclockwise.md).",
      "ko": "예를 들어, 막대 차트의 콘텐츠 방향은 [`AXChartDescriptor.ContentDirection.leftToRight`](axchartdescriptor/contentdirection-swift.enum/lefttoright.md)이고, 파이 차트는 [`AXChartDescriptor.ContentDirection.radialClockwise`](axchartdescriptor/contentdirection-swift.enum/radialclockwise.md)일 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "9e82814ee14bcf7d411b58ba9f82262638b9dd10d30f39ef44a909ec2ff6fcbb",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
